  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Change in internal energy for a cyclic process is zero. Thus,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8710;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">U</mi><mi>abc</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8710;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">U</mi><mi>ca</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><mo>&#8710;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">U</mi><mi>abc</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>&#8710;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">U</mi><mi>ca</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>180</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#916;Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#916;W</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#916;U</mi></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>250</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>60</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>&#916;W</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>180</mn></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#916;W</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>130</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi></math></p>"
